  "description": "Eunhasu, who was an ordinary university student in South Korea, suddenly, finds herself living in the Joseon era as a shaman named 'Mirinae'?!\n\nA street shaman in Joseon, named 'Mirinae,' was doing a gut, a Korean shamanistic ritual dance. At the moment she said, \"Oh God, descend upon us!\", a 21st-century History major, fourth-year student Eunhasu possessed her!\n\nAmidst the confusion of this unwanted time travel, Eunhasu, who was a student of history, begins to use her expertise to gain a reputation as the capable shaman Mirinae?!\n\n\"Since it's turned out like this, I guess I have to make a living as a shaman. After all, starving to death is not an option, right?!\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=2z0d), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=2e33), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/5037000548), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61378990), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9461395), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H044009135), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H044009135), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000056123)",
